  masterCtx.fillText('  - Flame Quenching: The golden fire on Chad\'s blade is snuffed out, billowing into black/purple quench smoke.', col1X, specY + 100 + lineH * 5);

  masterCtx.fillText('• TRIPLE-TIER SHADER & OPTICAL DEPTH PALETTE:', col1X, specY + 100 + lineH * 7);
  masterCtx.fillText('  - Void Core (#050508): Liquid obsidian PBR material with 0.08 roughness and 0.94 metalness.', col1X, specY + 100 + lineH * 8);
