1. **100% Procedural WebGL Geometry**: Build all meshes in Three.js buffer geometry. Never rely on external GLTF/OBJ downloads.
2. **The Chamfer Standard**: All blocks, buildings, and vehicles must use \`chamferBox\` with 0.04–0.08m bevels. No razor-sharp raw CG boxes.
